<h3 local-id=3D"a031071c46af" id=3D"ErrorHandling-ErrorLogTemplate:"><stron=
g>Error Log Template:</strong></h3>
<p local-id=3D"cce3fe80477f"><strong>Table Name: </strong>WRB Custom Error =
Logs</p>
<p local-id=3D"b528e49cb1e6"><strong>Name:</strong> <span style=3D"color: r=
gb(255,86,48);">&lt;Step Name&gt;</span> Failure - <span style=3D"color: rg=
b(255,86,48);">&lt;Record Name&gt;</span></p>
